@title Cabinet lesson project: parts drawn as devices on rails, in the plate and in 3D
@area Cabinet
# Devices show the typical front of their family (screws, poles, vents) with the DIN rail running behind the middle
# of each; in 3D the same parts have a front per pole, screws and ribs once they are 36 px or more on screen.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-lesson.novo
wait 30
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
shot plate
check_blank plate
check_layout
click_text 3D
wait 60
scroll 700 300 -30
wait 40
scroll 700 300 -30
wait 40
scroll 700 300 -30
wait 40
shot parts-3d
check_blank parts-3d
check_layout
